# An nbt text component shows a float with its f suffix, even when plain

data modify storage switch:temp array[0].display set string storage switch:temp array[0].value
data modify storage switch:temp suffix set string storage switch:temp array[0].value -1
execute if data storage switch:temp {suffix:"f"} run data modify storage switch:temp array[0].display set string storage switch:temp array[0].value 0 -1

